  objects:
    count: 1-7 per grid
    shape: solid filled rectangle (100% fill), non-square bbox
    dimensions: longer = 2 * shorter; shorter in 2-6, longer in 4-12
    orientation: wide (w > h) or tall (h > w); mix allowed
    fracture_line: |
      Across the shorter axis: 1 marker pixel per row (wide) or per col (tall).
      Marker offset along the longer axis uses exactly 2 adjacent values {S-1, S}
      (the two central indices, since L=2S). Each slice picks one; line is 8-connected.
